msgstr ""

msgctxt "6316"
msgid ""
"The next time you want to play, I'll only charge you 10,000 yen. I'm looking"
" forward to seeing you again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6328"
msgid "From 100,000 yen to 10,000? That's a pretty big discount."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6340"
msgid ""
"Simply put, you're the only one I've found who can handle playing the game."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6352"
msgid ""
"If I make it cheaper, you'll want to play again, right? I can't pass up this"
" chance to finally test my invention!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6364"
msgid "I see. I guess our interests overlap, then. I'll definitely be back."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6376"
msgid "Wonderful! I'll be waiting."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6388"
msgid ""
"Oh, just a moment. Tell me your email address, won't you? I'll contact you "
"if there are any new developments."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6400"
msgid "Sure."
msgstr "Certo."

msgctxt "6460"
msgid ""
"Hey! You can't do that to us! You have any idea what kind of trouble you "
"just got yourself into?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6472"
msgid ""
"That's a question I should be asking you. I don't have any patience for "
"idiots who don't even know their own organization."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6484"
msgid "Uh... What are you, an executive of the Tojo Clan or something...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6496"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6508"
msgid ""
"Um, never mind! No need to answer that, we'll just disappear! It'll be like "
"we were never here! Just let us go, please!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6520"
msgid "Get moving."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6592"
msgid "I suppose I should thank you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6604"
msgid ""
"No need. That kind of thing happens to me a lot, actually. Now, what's this "
"\"experience\" you were talking about?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6616"
msgid "Ah, yes. As I said, my name is Minamida."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6628"
msgid ""
"In the world of video games, the name \"Doctor Minamida\" is reasonably "
"famous. I guess it doesn't mean anything in this city, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6640"
msgid ""
"Until last month, I was running a small game development company. We "
"developed the smash hit YF6, and the success was helping us grow."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6652"
msgid "YF6? I've played that game... So what's this machine?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6664"
msgid ""
"My latest invention! Inner Fighter 7, the ultimate arcade machine. It's a "
"prototype⑬the only one in existence."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6676"
msgid "An arcade machine?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6688"
msgid "Indeed. A game machine such as you might find in an arcade."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6700"
msgid "So this \"experience\" is a video game?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6712"
msgid ""
"In so many words, yes. But this game is utterly unlike any game you've ever "
"played."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6724"
msgid "What's different about it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6736"
msgid "This machine allows players to play the game inside their very brains!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6748"
msgid ""
"It uses bleeding-edge technology and special electromagnetic waves to make "
"you feel like you're actually in the game fighting the enemies."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6760"
msgid ""
"What? If that were possible, it would be the invention of the century. And "
"not just for the gaming world, either..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6772"
msgid ""
"Perceptive, perceptive. You're quite right about that. It is indeed a great "
"invention, but it's not without its problems..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6784"
msgid "What problems?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6796"
msgid ""
"It seems that only people who have actually experienced physically fighting "
"for their lives are able to conjure up suitable opponents."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6808"
msgid ""
"I tried testing it on a high school student, but he ended up facing a "
"20-meter, fire-breathing dragon. The poor boy ran home crying."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6820"
msgid ""
"And there was someone else who accused me of using hypnosis to trick him. "
"Like I would use such quackery. But regardless, I can't get anyone to "
"recognize how amazing this is."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6832"
msgid "So you couldn't sell it and went bankrupt?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6844"
msgid ""
"Well, that was part of why we went bankrupt, but there was another reason as"
" well..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6856"
msgid "Hmm?"
msgstr "Mmh?"

msgctxt "6868"
msgid ""
"But that's enough about me. I'm sure you're eager to give my invention a "
"try, am I right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6880"
msgid "Okay, I'll try it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6892"
msgid ""
"You fight on a daily basis, don't you? I'm sure you'll be able to generate a"
" suitable opponent. I can't wait to see what happens!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6904"
msgid "Now, then. Please sit down."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6976"
msgid "Here we go."
msgstr "Eccoci qua."

msgctxt "6988"
msgid "All right."
msgstr "Va bene."

msgctxt "7000"
msgid ""
"There's still a lot I need to explain, but for now, why don't you just have "
"a look for yourself?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7012"
msgid ""
"We have to enter your name on the entry screen. What was it you said your "
"name was again?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7024"
msgid "Kiryu."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7036"
msgid "That's K-I-R-Y-U, correct? Got it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7048"
msgid ""
"From what I can tell, a player's health in IF7 depends on what level their "
"\"Soul\" is. Whatever that means."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7060"
msgid ""
"If your Soul's level isn't high enough, you won't be able to tell how much "
"health your opponent has, so you must ensure that you keep training your "
"Soul."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7072"
msgid ""
"If your Soul's level isn't high enough, you won't be able to tell how much "
"health your opponent has... But I think you'll be just fine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7084"
msgid "Now, let us get this experiment underway!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7120"
msgid ""
"Aaah, you look like a promising subject. Come on, then! I'll take your "
"100,000 yen now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7132"
msgid ""
"I'm not giving you money for no reason. What exactly am I paying 100,000 yen"
" for?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7144"
msgid ""
"An experience, my friend. An experience you could go your entire life "
"without having otherwise... You look the type who could handle it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7156"
msgid ""
"But it's a battle you'll never be able to win without sufficient mental "
"toughness. If you're confident in your strength, I'll take your 100,000 yen "
"now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7168"
msgid ""
"Did you bring 100,000 yen? If you have it, I must insist you hand it over "
"before we begin."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7180"
msgid "(Should I pay him...?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7192"
msgid "I see. That's a shame... Come back if you change your mind."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7264"
msgid "You don't seem to have enough money..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7276"
msgid "Come back when you get enough."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7348"
msgid "You paid <Color:8>100,000 yen<Color:Default>."
msgstr "Hai pagato <Color:8>50.000 yen<Color:Default>."

msgctxt "7360"
msgid ""
"Congratulations, you're my first customer since I arrived here! But don't "
"think too much about that... What's your name?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7372"
msgid "Kiryu."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7384"
msgid ""
"Kiryu-kun, eh? My name's Minamida. It wasn't so long ago that people from "
"all over the world knew the name \"Doctor Minamida.\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7396"
msgid "Never heard of you. Sorry."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7408"
msgid "You haven't!? Well, never mind. Shall we get started?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7468"
msgid "This isn't the \"experience\" you were talking about, is it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7480"
msgid "No. I've never seen these men before."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7492"
msgid "Hey, old man! We hear you're tryin' to sell somethin' here!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7504"
msgid "You know whose territory this is?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7516"
msgid ""
"You're sellin' something pretty expensive from what we hear. What is it, "
"anyway?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7528"
msgid ""
"I'm afraid that's a trade secret. I can't tell you unless you pay first!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7540"
msgid ""
"Yeah, right! We're here to smash that \"trade secret\" of yours to pieces! "
"Unless you wanna start payin' us protection money, that is!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7552"
msgid "Pay? With what? I have nothing but what you see right here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7564"
msgid ""
"But I'm going to be making some money soon... well, hopefully. If things "
"work out, I'll be more than happy to pay you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7576"
msgid "Huh!? What the hell are you goin' on about!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7588"
msgid "We'll teach you not to bring bullshit like that in our territory!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7600"
msgid "Whose territory is this?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7612"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7624"
msgid ""
"If you know what's good for you, you won't be stickin' your nose where it "
"don't belong."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7636"
msgid "I don't plan to. I'm just asking whose territory it is."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7648"
msgid "What's it to you, huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7660"
msgid ""
"Fine. Whatever. This is the territory of the Shiragi Family, a subsidiary of"
" the Tojo Clan! Everybody knows us around here!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7672"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7684"
msgid "What? Too scared to talk now?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7696"
msgid "Never heard of that family."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7708"
msgid ""
"You watch it, old man. We've been pretty nice up till now, but you're "
"pushin' it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7720"
msgid ""
"I don't remember the names of families that use violence to terrorize "
"innocent people."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7732"
msgid ""
"Anyway, this man promised me an experience like I've never had before, but "
"this isn't it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7744"
msgid ""
"What the hell are the two of you yappin' about!? I've had enough of this. "
"Let's kick both their asses!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7768"
msgid "I came to play."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7780"
msgid "Tell me the rules."
msgstr "Dimmi le regole."

msgctxt "7792"
msgid "Not right now."
msgstr "Non adesso."

msgctxt "7804"
msgid "Lethal Warrior"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7816"
msgid "Greedy Giant"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7828"
msgid "One-Eyed Demon"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7840"
msgid "Avenging Berserker"
msgstr ""

